        </li>
        <li>
          PwC's 11th Family Business Survey covering growth, professionalisation, and succession readiness among Indian family businesses.
          <a href="https://www.pwc.in/services/entrepreneurial-and-private-business/11th-family-business-survey-2023-india-report.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PwC India: 11th Family Business Survey 2023 India Report</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          PwC's Global NextGen Survey on how next-generation family members see growth, modernisation, and their own role in the business.
          <a href="https://www.pwc.in/services/entrepreneurial-and-private-business/nextgen.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PwC: Global NextGen Survey 2024</a>
        </li>
        <li>
