          <a href="https://startuptalky.com/startup-failure-success-rates-statistics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">StartupTalky: Startup Failure and Success Rates Research Report</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="faqs" class="container section faq-block">
